What is your assessment of the assignment? Was it helpful? Was it fun?

This assignment was quite interesting. It definitely consolidated our
knowledge of pointers, structs, and abstract data types. We learned a
lot about the various memory allocation techniques while writing our
functions and debugging. This assignment was pretty fun, especially when
our code finally compiled and ran correctly. 

